   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# ⚗ KreaAlchemicaMente · **K2AM**\n**Krea 2 · calibrated sampling · one straight line:** Load → LoRA → Prompt → Sampler → Save\n\nIdea & direction: **AlchemicaMente** · code: **Claude (Anthropic)** · nodes: [ComfyUI-AlchemicaSampler](https://github.com/Nessuno76/ComfyUI-AlchemicaSampler) · GPL-3.0"
   ],
   "color": "#2a2a2a",
   "bgcolor": "#1c1c1c"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    30,
    990
   ],
   "size": [
    420,
    500
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 7,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "### ⚗ Quick guide\n1. **Load** – Krea 2 Turbo + Qwen3-VL text encoder + Qwen-Image VAE.\n2. **LoRA** – up to 6, `(none)` = off.\n3. **Prompt** – write an *idea* (any language): Krea 2's own encoder writes the prompt. `mode → as written` to keep your text. Format: `aspect` + `megapixels`. NAG on = the negative works at cfg 1.\n4. **Sampler** – leave it as is: `profile (auto)` + `alchemica_calibrated` + calibration **v2** use the step spacing measured on your checkpoint. Two stages, resolution-corrected hand-off and **DeGrid** (Krea 2 VAE grid fix) are on.\n5. **Save** – pick drive and folder with 📁 *Browse folders…*; the file takes the workflow's name.\n\n**Tips** · more quality: `steps` 10-12 · more variety between seeds: `variety` 0.6 · strong LoRAs with \"wet\" skin: `variety` 0.15-0.2 · no profile yet? run *⚗ Alchemica Calibration* once on your checkpoint."
   ],
   "color": "#2a2a2a",
   "bgcolor": "#1c1c1c"
  }
